WEBVTT

00:00:02.610 --> 00:00:04.080
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:06.540
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:09.130
This time, we're all going to see 
a lot of musical instruments!

00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:12.060
That sure makes you happy, Miki!

00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:16.160
When I think about being surrounded by 
so many different sounds... It's just enthralling!

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:18.460
But since it's an outing for the whole gang...

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:20.730
We'll definitely need to 
make lunches for everyone!

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:22.570
This is going to be so much fun!

00:00:22.570 --> 00:00:24.000
Doki!

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:50.360
I'm gonna tell you a secret.

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:53.270
Don't tell <i>anyone</i>, okay?

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.160
Even though I'm not girly at all,

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:58.930
two certain boys said they like me!

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:01.870
Jump up a bit into the sky.

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:04.750
My dearest friends are always there.

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:07.580
Even if you suddenly Character Change,

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:10.490
I'll be there to stop you with my great big heart.

00:01:10.490 --> 00:01:13.360
Pinky swear!

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:15.760
Cross my heart!

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:18.970
Lucky, happy, leave it to me!

00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:22.020
That'd be universal peace, but...

00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:24.770
I'll end up protectin' everyone's hearts.

00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:27.540
Let's all smile together!

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:30.400
Lucky, happy, leave it to me!

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:33.210
That's world peace! Yeah, that!

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:36.440
Everyone has dreams, so I'm gonna protect 'em!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.260
Make a victory sign together!

00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:57.830
"Lifestyles of the Rich and 
Famous! Right at Ya!"  {non-literal, american reference added.  Lit translation: "Home visit of famous people"}

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:05.380
So let's begin today's "Lifestyles of 
the Rich and Famous! Right at Ya!"

00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:12.750
Today, we'll be visiting the world of a celebrated 
actress popular on variety shows, Mayuzumi Kahoru-san!

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:15.780
How are you all today? I'm Mayuzumi Kahoru!

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:17.630
Right at ya!

00:02:19.560 --> 00:02:22.510
Your mama's sure havin' a blast again today!

00:02:23.110 --> 00:02:25.340
So this is your film 
festival award, I see. {We called it both a best leading actress and international film festival award in episodes 55 and 64 respectively. - Asa we haven't been changing this to "Oscar" right?  I mean it's obviously suppossed to be an oscar but not actually use the official name for it}

00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:29.770
Yes! And this is my award for my 
performance at the comedy festival!

00:02:29.770 --> 00:02:30.590
That's big!

00:02:30.590 --> 00:02:33.420
I like this one because it stands out more.

00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:37.850
It's too bad they didn't film you, Lulu.

00:02:37.850 --> 00:02:39.550
Don't be ridiculous.

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:44.450
At this rate, Maman really will lose 
sight of what it means to be an actress.

00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:46.980
I have to get that Embryo right away!

00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:50.550
And considerin' that Tsukiyomi Ikuto 
is callin' it out, too,

00:02:50.550 --> 00:02:52.940
we really should get a move on!

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:54.510
I'm well aware!

00:02:54.510 --> 00:02:59.350
I won't let Tsukiyomi Ikuto 
or Easter get in my way!

00:02:59.350 --> 00:03:00.700
Lulu...

00:03:01.230 --> 00:03:06.410
Episode 83
Chance Encounter at the World Music Fair?

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:09.790
Hey, guys, look at this!

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:16.920
World Music Fair?

00:03:18.290 --> 00:03:19.730
You've heard of it?

00:03:19.730 --> 00:03:22.480
It's an event they hold 
in the next town over. {Shelbyville? ---ahahahahaha}

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:25.800
I've heard they display 
various items related to music.

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:28.150
It says they have a "make your own instrument" class!

00:03:28.150 --> 00:03:31.180
And they have rare instruments 
from around the world!

00:03:31.180 --> 00:03:33.100
And not just that, 
they have performances, too!

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:34.440
Sounds fun!

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:36.050
Doesn't it?

00:03:36.050 --> 00:03:39.150
Since we don't have 
school tomorrow, let's all go!

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:41.040
Why not?

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:41.970
Sure!

00:03:52.720 --> 00:03:54.410
Thinking about Ikuto?

00:03:57.350 --> 00:04:01.590
Easter is controlling him and 
making him hunt down the Embryo...

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:05.240
You don't think he'd show 
up at the fair, do you?

00:04:05.240 --> 00:04:07.960
Since it's a place where a large 
number of people will be gathered...

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:09.870
I think it's quite possible.

00:04:09.870 --> 00:04:14.520
Perhaps we're being overly cautious, 
but it's wise to be careful.

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:15.880
Yeah.

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:20.760
But there's no need to 
get all worried about it!

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:22.530
It's important to focus on having fun!

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:23.380
That's right!

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:25.630
Shall I make lunches?

00:04:25.630 --> 00:04:27.140
Don't forget snacks, too!

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:32.620
You're right. We don't do this 
every day, so let's have a blast!

00:04:32.820 --> 00:04:34.080
Yeah!

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:04.190
Hey, got any manga?

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:06.220
No, we don't have such things.

00:05:07.180 --> 00:05:11.490
All right, then maybe you and 
I could talk for bit...

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:12.410
Sweetheart.

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:14.790
Y-You and I?

00:05:15.090 --> 00:05:16.830
Don't fall for his little game.

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:21.060
Man, I can't believe he's 
making us babysit Ikuto.

00:05:21.060 --> 00:05:24.210
Well, the Director's a real slave driver.

00:05:24.210 --> 00:05:25.470
Oh, my old man.

00:05:26.060 --> 00:05:27.870
J-J-J-Just kidding!

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:30.190
He can make us do whatever he wants!

00:05:30.190 --> 00:05:32.740
Huh? He's gone...

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:44.300
I know Tsukiyomi Ikuto's 
been caught by Easter...

00:05:44.300 --> 00:05:46.030
Where the heck's he at?

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:50.420
I've gotta get Lulu some 
info on their violin plan!

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:54.030
Man, what a troublemaker!

00:05:54.030 --> 00:05:56.650
He's cool in a way, though...

00:05:56.650 --> 00:05:58.470
He is not!

00:05:58.470 --> 00:06:00.200
Think of the age difference!

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:01.630
Dagger in the heart.

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:04.220
He's regained his strength,

00:06:04.220 --> 00:06:07.640
so I believe he can withstand this experiment.

00:06:07.640 --> 00:06:11.720
Oh, and about the music event 
Easter's participating in...

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:16.280
The location and layout are great; it'll be the perfect place to put Tsukiyomi Ikuto to good use.

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:19.640
Excellent. Begin preparations.

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:20.510
Yes, sir!

00:06:39.450 --> 00:06:42.430
Hold it right there!

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:49.280
I wonder where Nana went.

00:06:59.450 --> 00:07:00.830
What?

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:03.770
Nana?

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:06.280
Lulu...

00:07:06.470 --> 00:07:09.260
Tsukiyomi Ikuto is going to be here.

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:12.350
The World Music Fair?

00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:14.950
Nana, you didn't...

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:21.040
You won't let Easter 
beat you... right... Lulu?

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:21.880
Nana!

00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:34.450
We must get to work 
on tomorrow's lunches!

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:37.710
Yeah, I'm totally looking 
forward to making them!

00:07:37.710 --> 00:07:39.380
You mean making one 
for Tadase-kun, right?

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:40.810
I-I didn't say that!

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:42.560
Oh, hey guys.

00:07:42.860 --> 00:07:43.820
Yoru!

00:07:43.820 --> 00:07:45.620
Still looking for Ikuto?

00:07:45.620 --> 00:07:47.080
Of course-nya!

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:49.130
I won't give up 'til I find him-nya!

00:07:49.130 --> 00:07:50.940
You're so determined.

00:07:50.940 --> 00:07:53.730
Hey! Why don't you come, too, Yoru?

00:07:54.730 --> 00:07:56.740
We're all going out tomorrow.

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:57.990
We'll be bringing lunches.

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:01.250
How can you goof off like that?

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:03.840
I don't have time to play around-nya!

00:08:03.840 --> 00:08:05.920
Thanks for inviting me and all,

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:09.180
but my great mission to find Ikuto cannot-

00:08:09.180 --> 00:08:11.780
We'll be bringing plenty of snacks, too!

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:17.210
Snacks! Well if there's gonna 
be snacks, I'm totally in-nya!

00:08:20.230 --> 00:08:21.270
The next day!

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:37.490
It sure is lively.

00:08:37.490 --> 00:08:39.790
I can hear so much music!

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:41.530
Yeah, it sounds great!

00:08:41.530 --> 00:08:43.460
Why are <i>you</i> here?

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:45.330
Don't sweat the details-nya.

00:08:58.060 --> 00:09:00.420
It's the "make your own instrument" class!

00:09:00.420 --> 00:09:03.220
Let's go, let's go! 
I bet it'll be a blast!

00:09:03.220 --> 00:09:04.230
Right, sure...

00:09:04.530 --> 00:09:05.840
Finished!

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:06.980
A straw flute!

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:10.060
Well done, now try making a sound with it.

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:10.980
Okay!

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:25.120
Why am I the only one?!

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:26.300
Let's go here next!

00:09:26.300 --> 00:09:28.040
Over there seems cool!

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:29.960
Okay, okay, I said I'm coming.

00:10:09.480 --> 00:10:10.890
Fujisaki-kun?

00:10:11.550 --> 00:10:14.050
I'm okay, don't worry.

00:10:14.900 --> 00:10:20.050
I intend to search at my own pace 
for what dancing means to me.

00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:22.960
And that answer...

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:30.770
Tadase-kun...

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:31.610
Here!

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:36.960
U-Um, I made too much, so if you'd like...

00:10:36.960 --> 00:10:38.860
She said she made too much...

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:42.860
But she actually made 
that just for you.

00:10:42.860 --> 00:10:44.160
Hey now!

00:10:44.460 --> 00:10:47.610
Excellent. An appropriate attitude for a loyal subject.

00:10:47.610 --> 00:10:50.290
So where is mine?

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:51.450
There isn't one for you.

00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:53.380
Just for Tadase-kun.

00:10:53.800 --> 00:10:56.410
What? Just for Tadase? Not fair!

00:10:56.410 --> 00:10:58.800
Just accept it, Yaya.

00:10:58.800 --> 00:11:00.160
Oh, be quiet!

00:11:02.860 --> 00:11:06.020
I wish Ikuto could eat some of these-nya.

00:11:06.630 --> 00:11:10.260
I thought I just felt his presence...

00:11:10.260 --> 00:11:12.520
Hmm, my imagination, maybe?

00:11:17.050 --> 00:11:18.410
We've arrived!

00:11:18.410 --> 00:11:19.650
Finish that calibration!

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:20.290
Right!

00:11:43.900 --> 00:11:45.260
Thank you!

00:11:49.380 --> 00:11:51.260
She's cool!

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:01.060
Everything seems all right.

00:12:01.060 --> 00:12:02.320
Okay then, let's try it.

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:37.050
The Director will be here soon! Hurry!

00:12:37.050 --> 00:12:37.730
Right!

00:12:41.370 --> 00:12:44.800
Who are you? Don't just 
come barging in here!

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:47.290
What?

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:06.300
You're...

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:13.510
You can take it from here.

00:13:14.220 --> 00:13:14.810
Wait!

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:18.230
Why are you doing this?

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:23.820
No particular reason. I just want to make things harder for Easter.

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:29.050
I'll never let you or Easter 
get your hands on the Embryo!

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:32.450
And don't y'all forget it!

00:13:46.240 --> 00:13:49.090
Why do I have to dance, too?

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:50.750
Well, why not?

00:13:50.750 --> 00:13:51.650
Turn!

00:13:51.650 --> 00:13:53.220
Hey now!

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:54.500
Turn!

00:13:56.580 --> 00:13:59.010
I wonder if I could ever dance like them?

00:13:59.010 --> 00:14:01.170
I bet it's hard...

00:14:01.170 --> 00:14:03.030
But I wanna try!

00:14:04.700 --> 00:14:06.150
You're lost, aren't you?

00:14:08.710 --> 00:14:12.170
I definitely feel Ikuto's presence-nya...

00:14:20.740 --> 00:14:23.300
I don't think Easter is going to try anything.

00:14:23.820 --> 00:14:26.510
I guess we really were just overthinking it.

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:27.960
Maybe so.

00:14:33.450 --> 00:14:34.490
Amu-chan.

00:14:36.530 --> 00:14:38.190
Let's check out some more exhibits.

00:14:40.160 --> 00:14:41.230
Sure!

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:49.900
Where should we go next, Amu-chan?

00:14:49.900 --> 00:14:51.410
Hm, good question.

00:15:02.820 --> 00:15:04.110
Amu-chan!

00:15:04.510 --> 00:15:07.210
There's another ? Egg!

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:07.930
Let's go!

00:15:07.930 --> 00:15:08.470
Yeah!

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:33.620
Now come, Embryo!

00:15:34.040 --> 00:15:35.540
Lulu!

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:36.870
Hinamori Amu!

00:15:39.590 --> 00:15:41.370
Hotori-kun, Amu-chan!

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:42.480
Guys!

00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:44.170
I'm going to dance...

00:15:44.570 --> 00:15:46.250
On a grand stage...

00:15:46.950 --> 00:15:49.170
Under the spotlights...

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:50.470
I'm going to dance!

00:15:57.450 --> 00:16:00.520
Character Transformation: Dancing Dream!

00:16:01.450 --> 00:16:04.630
I'll give you all the dancing bug!

00:16:10.730 --> 00:16:12.650
Yaya, are you okay?

00:16:13.860 --> 00:16:15.880
Rima, Yaya!

00:16:15.880 --> 00:16:16.680
What the...

00:16:16.680 --> 00:16:18.560
My body's moving on its own!

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:19.610
Rima!

00:16:19.610 --> 00:16:20.630
Yaya-tan!

00:16:20.630 --> 00:16:21.410
Miki!

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:22.410
Roger!

00:16:25.090 --> 00:16:26.990
My heart:

00:16:26.990 --> 00:16:27.920
My heart:

00:16:28.220 --> 00:16:29.590
Unlock!

00:16:48.840 --> 00:16:51.410
Character Transformation: Platinum Royal!

00:16:53.720 --> 00:16:56.380
Character Transformation: Amulet Spade!

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:05.460
Dance, all of you!

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:08.840
Let my performance stir you!

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:10.170
Holy Crown!

00:17:14.240 --> 00:17:17.400
Prism Music!

00:17:23.260 --> 00:17:25.090
Watch this!

00:17:45.450 --> 00:17:46.870
Amu-chi!

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:48.580
Stop us, stop us!

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:52.680
Stop us, stop us, stop us!

00:17:53.230 --> 00:17:55.970
That girl ain't half bad!

00:17:59.500 --> 00:18:00.760
What should I do?

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:03.970
I'll make you all dance!

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:04.600
Wait!

00:18:06.510 --> 00:18:08.510
Is that what you call dancing?

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:10.480
You're wrong!

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:12.540
What did you say?

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:13.650
Fujisaki-kun...

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:16.170
I'll teach you...

00:18:17.110 --> 00:18:18.530
what dancing really is.

00:18:21.100 --> 00:18:24.580
Sounds interesting. Fine, I'll dance with you.

00:18:54.840 --> 00:18:56.860
Amu-chan, look at that.

00:19:13.940 --> 00:19:15.420
No more...

00:19:37.620 --> 00:19:39.100
Wow!

00:19:39.100 --> 00:19:41.290
He's got some moves on him.

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:45.700
Do you understand now? 
Dancing is about freedom.

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:49.770
It's not about controlling 
or being controlled.

00:19:49.770 --> 00:19:51.390
Freedom?

00:19:52.260 --> 00:19:55.130
Oh man, but I...

00:19:59.610 --> 00:20:00.630
Amu-chan!

00:20:02.390 --> 00:20:04.930
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:11.190
Open Heart!

00:20:51.920 --> 00:20:53.320
Lulu?

00:20:53.320 --> 00:20:54.920
I'm fine.

00:20:54.920 --> 00:20:58.060
I'll definitely get the Embryo for myself!

00:21:02.380 --> 00:21:03.280
What about Ikuto?

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:05.530
I was sure he was here-nya.

00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:07.980
But no X Eggs appeared.

00:21:07.980 --> 00:21:09.950
Wasn't it just your imagination?

00:21:33.960 --> 00:21:35.230
That sound!

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:38.100
Ikuto-nya! Ikuto's close by-nya!

00:21:38.100 --> 00:21:38.940
Ikuto?

00:21:45.880 --> 00:21:48.630
Ikuto, Ikuto!

00:21:48.630 --> 00:21:51.330
Where are you-nya?!

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:52.490
Ikuto...

00:21:55.760 --> 00:21:59.060
And what should we do about the 
person who aided his escape?

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:02.240
I'll deal with that girl's punishment later.

00:22:02.240 --> 00:22:05.000
Ikuto takes precedence for now.

00:22:05.000 --> 00:22:10.600
Unfortunate child, your fate is 
to be chained to me forever.

00:22:12.740 --> 00:22:14.680
Forever.

00:22:31.690 --> 00:22:36.260
Maybe I was wrong to pretend not to notice your worries.

00:22:36.260 --> 00:22:41.070
It's okay if you can't tell me everything.

00:22:41.070 --> 00:22:43.450
With that dark look on your face,

00:22:43.450 --> 00:22:45.690
go ahead and scream dark things.

00:22:45.690 --> 00:22:50.000
You shouldn't leave all those heavy feelings inside.

00:22:50.000 --> 00:22:51.480
Ride On!

00:22:54.870 --> 00:22:57.680
If you don't... If it's like that...

00:22:57.680 --> 00:23:00.600
You couldn't tell me if you wanted to, huh?

00:23:01.860 --> 00:23:04.350
I get it.

00:23:04.350 --> 00:23:07.010
I'm sure your circumstances will change one day.

00:23:07.010 --> 00:23:10.040
That time will come! That time is now!

00:23:13.860 --> 00:23:15.670
Don't you want to have someone

00:23:15.670 --> 00:23:18.300
say congratulations to you once in your life?

00:23:18.300 --> 00:23:23.230
Doesn't the breeze feel nice today?

00:23:23.230 --> 00:23:27.600
Even if you feel like it's all you can do to survive...

00:23:27.600 --> 00:23:32.470
You can make your life into something you enjoy. It's so nice!

00:23:32.470 --> 00:23:37.290
"Everything's for you."

00:23:37.290 --> 00:23:41.890
How about that?

00:23:43.590 --> 00:23:45.040
My boy!

00:23:50.320 --> 00:23:53.190
Nikaidou-sensei isn't exactly 
"teacher of the year," you know?

00:23:53.190 --> 00:23:55.840
Yeah... He trips and falls over air.

00:23:55.840 --> 00:23:58.280
And I get the feeling 
he's always out to lunch.

00:23:58.280 --> 00:23:59.780
That's not true!

00:23:59.780 --> 00:24:01.960
Sensei is an excellent teacher!

00:24:01.960 --> 00:24:03.050
How, exactly?

00:24:03.050 --> 00:24:05.140
Um... Well...

00:24:05.140 --> 00:24:07.440
Honestly, he's just splendid!

00:24:07.440 --> 00:24:09.990
Whoa! Su's actually at a loss for words!

00:24:09.990 --> 00:24:12.100
Next time on Shugo Chara!! Doki:

00:24:12.100 --> 00:24:14.340
Nikaidou-sensei's Actually a Teacher!?

00:24:14.340 --> 00:24:18.960
There must be a child somewhere 
out there who understands him!
